Expose Wayle's native dashboard to the external Waybar.

Wayle's own bar stays hidden. A one-pixel transparent layer-shell host keeps
the native dashboard popover available, and com.wayle.Shell1.DashboardToggle
lets Waybar open and close it. The user-session action card is omitted, so the
dashboard has no lock, logout, reboot, or power-off buttons.

